ngs":{"title":"","logo_opacity":100,"divider":false}},"420b2d2b-af38-48d8-bbb8-59a35b9d8e1d":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_86_ef409afa-074f-44ea-ad63-6016557c92f7.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"seam-free tape for combat sports","text":"<p>Join mats together for a seamless look. This vinyl tape features a strong adhesive backing and a vinyl surface that matches the tatami surface. Can be used for both temporary and permanent mat setups.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"BUY seam-free tape","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/seam-free-tape-for-combat-sports-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"4dbcb0cc-4238-46a7-b75c-d7b728e6fb1e":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"Taishan Competition Judo Mats","text":"<p>These martial art\/Judo mats are designed to provide footing for grappling\/striking sports while offering protection against injuries from slams, takedowns, and falls.<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Skill level:<\/strong> Intermediate to competitive fighters<\/p>","button_label":"buy taishan competition judo mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/taishan-competition-judo-mats","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/samuel-castro-1zrGPNGP8H0-unsplash_1_9ac03b93-265d-4bf2-93c0-c0810c3890f7.png","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"94c7b3df-d4cc-494e-844f-893c7782e65e":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593667201__94c7b3df-d4cc-494e-844f-893c7782e65e-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/bdrako_2_1_1080x_85fa4103-8760-47c7-803b-6c58ff0efd2f.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"drako martial arts crash mat","text":"<p>High-density Drako Martial Arts Crash Mats offer robust protection, making them ideal for falls, tumbles, or general groundwork. A prime choice for injury prevention in various martial arts disciplines or high intensity.<\/p><p>Mat Thickness: 8\"<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$9.53\/Sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy drako crash mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/drako-martial-arts-crash-mat"}},"template--14486593667201__94c7b3df-d4cc-494e-844f-893c7782e65e-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/sc_1080x_5ee60449-00e3-4b08-8903-01e94d516e09.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"safety cushions","text":"<p>Made with a honeycomb foam and vinyl surface to offer durability and ultimate landing protection. These are perfect during gymnastics and cheerleading training.<br\/><br\/>Mat Thickness: Available from 10\" up to 30\"<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$27.97\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy safety cushions","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/safety-cushions"}},"template--14486593667201__94c7b3df-d4cc-494e-844f-893c7782e65e-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/competition_landing_a03ac18a-cb24-46b2-b051-143e83d9a6dc.png","image_width":650,"title":"Competition landing mats","text":"<p>These mats combine the firmness of cross-link polyethylene to support stable footing with the flexibility of polyurethane foam as a bottom layer, providing enough cushion for optimal shock absorption.<br\/><br\/>Mat Thickness: Available in 12cm & 20cm<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$25.25\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy competition landing mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/competition-landing-mats"}},"68028e00-dc30-4cd8-8329-b5c1dd1d5649":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Throw-Mats_aa4da9dc-9b56-4b99-86a7-c0770febcfe2.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Throw mats","text":"<p>These Th